 "lead_html": "<p>Owner, by card 2026-10-22 (<i>May we draft replacements for FlowWorks pipe art?</i> &rarr; <b>Draft all of it</b>): a DRAFT pipe atlas per look with real 3-way (tee) and 4-way (cross) fittings, ONE coupling per joint (where two cells meet) instead of three or four bands per cell, and an end cap matched to each look; plus Industrial, Modern and Futuristic looks of the live 4-port pump (today every look shows the rusty one). The REFERENCE pictures beside each atlas row show a test layout drawn from the draft and the same layout from today's atlas. Pick a column or note what to change. Nothing is installed; a pump look also needs a small def/C# change after your pick. Item PIPE_FITTINGS_REDRAW_NO_MORE_LADDERS; study Transient/pile_2026-10-22/joints_study.md (D9, D10, D11). The joint fittings (flange, coupler, saddle) are on their own sheet, joint_fittings_sheet_2026-10-22.</p>"
}